# Local blob store
#
# `LocalDiskBlobStore`'s root. Every file uploaded through a dev server lands
# here as real bytes — a `.woff2` from the 1.22.0 browser pass is what put this
# entry in the file, having been staged for commit as though it were source.
# The directory is created on demand and holds nothing anyone should carry.
.data/

